{"id":886866,"title":"47｜发布智能体：发布API接口","content":"本节课介绍了将搭建好的智能体如智能客服发布为API接口的过程。首先，在平台上点击右上角的“发布”按钮，获取API访问地址及调用方式。接着，使用Postman工具创建POST请求，填写API提供的URL，并选择Bearer Token认证方式，从平台获取API密钥后填入。在请求Body中，采用JSON格式输入问题内容，例如询问课程特色，设置响应模式为流式或一次性。通过发送请求测试API，可在系统日志中查看交互记录。若需保持对话连续性，可保存并传递conversation ID用于后续请求。此外，API还支持阻塞模式，便于更直观地展示结果。最后，强调了该过程简单易行，用户只需在其应用或系统中调用相应接口即可实现集成。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401533,"user_name":"菠萝吹雪—Code","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1650378,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"A5B2FC661EE17D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/2e/ca/469f7266.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752509691,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"打卡！\n感谢老师的分享，受益匪浅！之前的学习都是把精力放在直接写代码上，对这些Agent运行机制没有体会那么深，看完老师的演示，加深了对原理的理解，有了更新的印象！赞！赞！赞！","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":403827,"user_name":"黑山老妖","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1115958,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"A1659F99C5BE1E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/07/36/d677e741.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1764934041,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师，代码在哪里","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":403548,"user_name":"徐相韡","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1823594,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"6C3FEB28D5C222","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/5xHXQrYSQcBb3bKOJwyIxWIqlu6lBp4jg0kweZeUoj0bMPWSkMEI74am1M0G1VfZiaoqwcZIeZeNDKZIaiarFKNA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1763951279,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师，可否来个生产级别的实例？ 比如在企业中的类似助手需求，比如：告诉助手“帮我报销这个月的出差费用” ，这种需要的实际操作","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402542,"user_name":"Jason Ding","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1365944,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"E62AB51